OL,3,GNEWSAGang stole Land Rover Defenders
OL,4,Aworth #600k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gang who stole 33 Land Rover
OL,7,FDefenders worth more than #600,000 in
OL,8,Fjust eight months have been jailed.
OL,10,FThe four men targeted vehicles across
OL,11,Fsix police force areas between
OL,12,FSeptember 2024 and May 2025, including
OL,13,Fin Worcestershire, Herefordshire,
OL,14,FGloucestershire and Powys.
OL,16,FAll four pleaded guilty to conspiracy
OL,17,Fto steal vehicles and were sentenced at
OL,18,FHereford Crown Court on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
