OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Mercia Police said the Defenders
OL,7,Fwere stolen from locations including
OL,8,FMalvern, Bromyard, Droitwich,
OL,9,FLeominster, Tenbury Wells, Suckley,
OL,10,FKingsland and Storridge.
